Are you making a movie, some school project or need custom and realistic screenshots? Simulate it together with this powerful tool which will allow you to create the top most realistic Messages! 

Have fun by following these 4 easy steps:
1. Create a dialog.
2. Set recipient name.
3. Add various messages to make it look like a real conversation.
4. Save it! 

Upgrade to "Plus Pack" and you'll get more awesome features:
• Create more then 2 Dialogs;
• Add more then 5 messages per Dialog;
• Adjust time for each message;
• Change message status;
• Change Recipient status;
• Change Recipient photo;
